# Rust guidance
{%- if use_tauri %}

Read `.codex/languages/typescript.md` for the shared Tauri layout and complete repository quality gate, including for Rust-only shell changes. It runs the Rust checks against `src-tauri/Cargo.toml`.
{%- else %}

Run the Rust quality checks from the repository root:

```bash
cargo fmt --all --check
cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings
cargo test --all-targets --all-features
```
{%- endif %}
